        "pf_5669c87f_value": "Love it!! I had 2,500 photos on my iPhone and doubles. The stick in less than 3 minutes downloaded and deleted doubles. Now my phone is freed up and 2,000 originals are on the stick😃. Great gift idea for Christmas 🎄\rThanks also for the support of staff in answering emails so quickly.",
        "pf_9f997486_value": "This SO easy to work with. Simply pug it in, load the small app, and click. Sit back have a coffee or two. (If you are picture hoarder like me a short nap is good) I don't mean to imply it is slow I had a lot of pics.",
        "pf_4798ab27_value": "Love it love it love it One of the best things I have ever bought to put pictures on I have almost 4000 pictures on in and still have Room to add more easy to work easy to use. Such a great thing to have.",
